@startuml
title Resume after a kill during the map invocation

actor Operator
participant "avarice CLI" as CLI
database Ledger
participant "Staging clone" as Staging
participant "GSD tools" as GSD
participant "Claude Code host" as Host
participant "PreToolUse hook" as Hook
participant graphify

== Before the kill ==
CLI -> Ledger : reserve invocation, launch recorded as started with session ID
CLI -> Host : launch (detached process group)
Host -> Hook : tool calls
Hook -> Ledger : charge tool calls and subagents
Host -> Staging : write map files
Operator ->x CLI : kill (no cleanup)
note over Ledger : launch row stays started,\none invocation unit stays reserved,\nlease stays recorded until it expires
note over Host, Hook : host keeps running and the hook keeps charging\nthe run's tool-call budget

== Resume ==
Operator -> CLI : resume ONBOARDING_ID
CLI -> Ledger : read onboarding
alt already in a stop state
  CLI --> Operator : report state, no lease taken
else not stopped
  CLI -> Ledger : take lease
  alt lease still live (up to 180 s after last renewal)
    CLI --> Operator : refused, lease held (exit 3); nothing is reaped
  else lease expired
    Ledger --> CLI : takeover, fence raised
  end
end

== Reap by session ID ==
CLI -> Ledger : read launch rows left started
CLI -> Host : find process by session ID, terminate its group, kill after grace
alt process survives, or search fails
  CLI --> Operator : failed (exit 70), rows stay started, no stage runs
else ended or none found
  CLI -> Ledger : warning event if a process was ended
  note right of CLI : a host without a reap capability\nskips this step silently
end

== Reconcile the map invocation ==
CLI -> Ledger : mapping to paused
CLI -> Ledger : count launches and validations
CLI -> Staging : read required map files
alt more launches than validations and every required file present
  CLI -> Ledger : launch row reconciled, reconciled event
  CLI -> GSD : stamp the map (full or fast)
  CLI -> Ledger : validating (no second launch)
  note over CLI, Ledger : the dead reservation is charged\nat the next reservation (the intel invocation)
else files incomplete
  CLI -> Ledger : launch row interrupted, back to mapping
  CLI -> Ledger : reserve again: dead reservation charged as spent\nat its cost cap (no wall clock), warning event
  alt any budget spent
    CLI -> Ledger : blocked (budget exhausted)
    CLI --> Operator : stopped (exit 3)
  else granted
    CLI -> Ledger : new launch recorded with new session ID
    CLI -> Host : launch again
    Host -> Hook : tool calls
    Hook -> Ledger : charge from the same run budget (earlier charges kept)
    Host --> CLI : final result
    CLI -> Ledger : settle, classify, stamp, transition as in the onboard flow
  end
end

ref over CLI, Ledger : continue as in the onboard flow from validation to activation
note over graphify : not involved until the index steps
@enduml
